### Third-Party Data & Service Attributions

Northstar Weather interfaces with the following open data services and libraries under their respective terms:

1. **Open-Meteo**: Weather forecast, geocoding, and air quality APIs are provided by Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com) under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International Public License (CC BY 4.0).
2. **OpenStreetMap**: Map imagery and geographic data are provided by OpenStreetMap contributors (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright) under the Open Database License (ODbL).
3. **Leaflet**: Interactive mapping engine (https://leafletjs.com) licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.
4. **BigDataCloud**: Client reverse geocoding provided by BigDataCloud (https://www.bigdatacloud.com).
